<p>Deliver a devastating axe kick dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">133%, 155%, 172%, 187%, 200%</acronym> damage. If the blow connects your target is brain damaged, causing all talents to fail for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 2, 3, 3</acronym> turns and earning 2 combo points.</p><p>This effect cannot be saved against, though it can be dodged and checks confusion immunity.</p>